{"resourceIdentifier":"4695","resourceName":"Xinxiang Yanmai Biogas Utilization Project","description":"Xinxiang Yanmai Biogas Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) is located at Yanjin County Industrial Agglomeration Zone, Yanjin County, Xinxiang City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is owned and implemented by Xinxiang Yanmai Food Co., Ltd\r\n\r\nThe project will introduce new anaerobic waste water treatment system (Two anaerobic\r\nDigesters with effective volume of 8000m3 and 5000m3 separately) to treat waste water from starch production of Xinxiang Yanmai Food Co., Ltd.. The project uses digesters to treat waste water, collect and utilized the generated biogas to avoid methane emissions. The generated biogas will be captured and used for heat generation which will be used for starch production\r\nwith 8t/h biogas boiler within the project site. The residual waste from the digester will be used for soil application. Wastewater from the waste water treatment system will be discharged to Yanjin Municipal Sewage Treatment Plant for advanced treatment. \r\n\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the waste water was treated in open anaerobic lagoon at the project site and generated methane was emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility. The project is expected to avoid GHG emissions of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas.","location":{"latitude":35.190000,"longitude":114.120000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-12-14","endExclusive":"2024-01-14","endInclusive":"2024-01-13"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4695"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Xinxiang Yanmai Food Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province